severian-sev

sev            the ember: status, quick menu, short ways to the sev* tools
sevsettings    one menu for everyday settings (fuzzel)

Waybar: add the block from waybar-module.jsonc and these styles:
  #custom-sev         { color: #b5523b; }
  #custom-sev.awake   { color: #c9a66b; }
  #custom-sev.worried { color: #d06a50; }
Refresh after an update: pkill -RTMIN+8 waybar

Sway: settings are saved to ~/.config/sway/config.d/90-sevsettings.conf.
The sway config needs:   include ~/.config/sway/config.d/*
Floating terminal:       for_window [app_id="sev-float"] floating enable
Keybinding (suggestion): bindsym $mod+comma exec sevsettings
